  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **St. Stephen** (1 other source): Listed as a Grateful Dead cover, appearing in the setlist as an unreleased song [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Stench of the Unburied**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Against Pollution**: back after 25 archived shows (732 days) [3]\n- **St. Stephen**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Surrounded**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Itzcuintli-Totzli Days**: back after 183 archived shows (4990 days); rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2017-06-01.SBD.AUD.Matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 24 songs; 125 min [1]\n- **tmg2017-06-01**: source not stated; 25 songs; 125 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2017-06-01.SBD.AUD.Matrix**: taped by anonymous; transferred by blg; source: Source: [SBD > M10] + [Schoeps CCM4 > Tinybox > M10] => FLAC [1]. Also: Matrix recording combining a soundboard feed with a Schoeps CCM4 audience capture run through a Tinybox into an M10 recorder; Mastering by BLG used Audition, iZotope RX9 and Ozone 9, WavePad and xACT, then FLAC encoding; notes compiled November 2021 [1]\n- **tmg2017-06-01**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by D.King Gallery: [The Mountain Goats 2017 Fillmore F1496 Poster - D. King Gallery](https://www.dking-gallery.com/store/FIL_1496.html) [4]",
